/span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_d\">\\(L_d\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"21f2d14c4c84bf99\" href=\"?note=21f2d14c4c84bf99\" title=\"73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation\">73-df-diagonal-nonacceptance-notation</a>，词语言类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6759b2502900015f\" href=\"?note=6759b2502900015f\" title=\"73-df-enumerable-language-notation\">73-df-enumerable-language-notation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a>；本条的编码语言采用该同一包，不能在定义与结论之间换用另一个包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>旧七元组词语言实例中的固定空白字符满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\nL_d\\notin\\mathrm{RE}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}5.2}\\vdash\nL_d\\notin\\mathrm{RE}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的兼容接口。数字标签与 aliases 仅是本目录历史编号，不对应第三版的定理或定义编号；书源定位以 source_ref 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"